<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD JATS (Z39.96) Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v1.0 20120330//EN" "JATS-archivearticle1.dtd"><article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" article-type="retraction"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">J Exp Med</journal-id><journal-id journal-id-type="hwp">jem</journal-id><journal-title-group><journal-title>The Journal of Experimental Medicine</journal-title></journal-title-group><issn pub-type="ppub">0022-1007</issn><issn pub-type="epub">1540-9538</issn><publisher><publisher-name>The Rockefeller University Press</publisher-name></publisher></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmid">19364884</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">2715045</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="publisher-id">186.7.11194309r</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1084/jem.186.7.11194309r</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Retraction</subject></subj-group></article-categories><title-group><article-title>Role of interleukin 12 and costimulators in T cell anergy in                vivo</article-title></title-group><contrib-group><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Van Parijs</surname><given-names>Luk</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Perez</surname><given-names>Victor L.</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Biuckians</surname><given-names>Andre</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Maki</surname><given-names>Robert G.</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>London</surname><given-names>Cheryl A.</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Abbas</surname><given-names>Abul K.</given-names></name></contrib></contrib-group><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><day>11</day><month>5</month><year>2009</year></pub-date><volume>206</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>1207</fpage><lpage>1207</lpage><permissions><copyright-statement>&#x000a9; 2009 The Rockefeller University Press</copyright-statement><copyright-year>2009</copyright-year></permissions></article-meta></front><body><p>Vol. 186, No. 7, October 6, 1997. Pages <related-article related-article-type="retracted-article" vol="186" page="1119" id="d32e87" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="9314560" ext-link-type="pubmed">1119&#x02013;1128</related-article>.</p><p>At the request of Harvard Medical School (HMS) and the Brigham and Women's            Hospital (BWH), the editors of the Journal of Experimental Medicine hereby retract the            article, &#x0201c;Role of IL-12 and costimulators in T cell anergy in vivo&#x0201d;            (1997. J. Exp. Med. 186:1119&#x02013;1128), by Luk Van Parijs, Victor L. Perez, Andre            Biuckians, Robert G. Maki, Cheryl A. London, and Abul K. Abbas. The basis of this            retraction, according to HMS and BWH, is that &#x0201c;Figure 4 of the paper,            determined to have been prepared by Dr. Van Parijs, is erroneous.&#x0201d;</p></body></article>